books.synopsis:
In the previous life, Jiang Xuening was the benchmark of a Mary Su. For the throne of the Empress, she hooked up and messed around with men.

When she was dating the Emperor, the rebel was her spare tire;

When she was dating the student, the teacher was her spare tire;

When she was dating the boss, the subordinate was her spare tire;

When she was befriending a woman, a man was her spare tire……？

Every day is a Shura Field!
